The MyIAM AI Chatbot is evolving beyond a traditional chatbot, combining Generative and Agentic AI capabilities and leveraging the ITG Twin Agentic framework.

Using RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation), the Agent can already answer questions about MyIAM processes. Work is now progressing on read-only Agentic capabilities, which will allow users to ask more contextual questions based on their MyIAM information, with the required security and access controls.

Designed for MyIAM end users, the initiative aims to help users find the information and answers they need more independently, improving the overall MyIAM user experience while helping to reduce repetitive queries handled by the Support team.

This evolution also marks an important step towards Agentic AI within IAM and opens the way for future AI-enabled IAM use cases.

The MyIAM AI Chatbot is not yet live. Stay tuned for updates!


